      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why don't you come back after becoming stronger?",
      "translation" : "變強之後再回來吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Maybe, level 130.",
      "translation" : "至少要達到130級吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "A long time ago, this castle did not look like this.",
      "translation" : "很久以前，這座城堡並不是現在這個樣子。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah, I'm sorry. I'm muttering in front of a stranger.",
      "translation" : "啊，抱歉。我竟然當著陌生人的面自言自語。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My name is Hugin. I'm studying the dimensional gap between time and space.",
      "translation" : "我叫休金，正在研究時空之間的次元裂縫。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There's something like that here?",
      "translation" : "這裡也有那樣的東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Have you ever wondered about the history of Glast Heim?",
      "translation" : "你有沒有想過古城的歷史？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There was a King named Shumiche who was known as a tyrant in the history of the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom.",
      "translation" : "盧恩-米德加茲王國的歷史上，曾有一位名叫舒米切的國王，被稱為暴君。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Time will reveal the true answers if we look in the right places.",
      "translation" : "只要找對地方，時間終會揭示真相。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't care about history",
      "translation" : "我對歷史不感興趣"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That is interesting. Did you find anything?",
      "translation" : "這很有趣。你發現了什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Really? Hmm, please come back later when you are interested then.",
      "translation" : "真的嗎？嗯，那等你感興趣的時候再回來吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Actually, dimensional time travel is possible but I'm too afraid to go there.",
      "translation" : "其實，次元時空旅行是可行的，只是我太害怕，不敢進去。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It might be possible for you!",
      "translation" : "或許你能做到！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do you want to time travel?",
      "translation" : "你想進行時空旅行嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No, thanks.",
      "translation" : "不用了，謝謝"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes, of course I do!",
      "translation" : "當然想！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Really? But, jumping gigawatts, this is such a great opportunity.",
      "translation" : "真的嗎？天哪，這可是千載難逢的好機會！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I knew that you would understand what I said. Well, please tell me what you want to do.",
      "translation" : "我就知道你會理解我的話。那麼，告訴我你想做什麼吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 77,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Umm? Did you see me at another place? I don't think so. What about this time?",
      "translation" : "嗯？你之前在別的地方見過我嗎？我想沒有吧。這次又有什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why don't you make a party with more than 1 person and talk to me again?",
      "translation" : "先組建一支至少有兩人的隊伍，再來和我說話吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hugin]",
      "translation" : "[休金]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Have we met before? No way. It's my first time seeing you. What do you want?",
      "translation" : "我們以前見過嗎？不可能，這是我第一次見你。有什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Enter Old Glast Heim",
      "translation" : "進入舊葛拉斯特海姆"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Hugin",
